   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "e3d3dea3-aca6-438e-90ce-2de51fe8150b"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Method"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "c1372368-6c7a-4e5f-8e5d-b7938dfa717d"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "911823ad-6ef4-4a3a-a068-3788a1967699"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "81eb8a6a-96a9-479c-a11c-505271e83659"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "20368948-9fa9-4d62-aeab-e89052920d5e"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Exhaustive\>\"", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Pruning\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "spec"}]}], "}"}]], 
      "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "99f930d5-6e9a-4042-b308-8b2cbd6475a2"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "394e7336-8184-4c41-84c2-0ff010490126"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "fa3f5ba8-574f-4d35-a7bd-05c246c0f171"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"dec4a6c4-6e99-48dc-bf42-f96680d7a4b6"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["Automatic"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a591c74e-7f6a-4691-a2bf-b8893f021839"],
     " resolves by the count: ",
     Cell[BoxData["All"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "b26de0fb-b00f-4132-a326-7fad49d3c6b4"],
     " to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Exhaustive\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "814f566c-b2cf-43bc-88b5-31d6de43ddbc"],
     ", the pool; a bounded or absent count to ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "a32467a2-7e69-478f-83ea-73dd805eb724"],
     ", which takes the admissible pairs and the branches of each DAG in \
candidate order, so the count-less call is deterministic. ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomGreedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2a92a7e3-d9aa-4862-bc33-746495cfc555"],
     " takes them in random order, seeded by an ambient ",
     Cell[BoxData["SeedRandom"], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "0878810a-f9df-413d-81c7-16774b602f49"],
     ". The class is the same under every value; ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Pruning\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "2d20921b-9fc1-4889-a22d-962e24c93b10"],
     " is accepted and inert, the pool having no frontier to cap."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"928895d2-51ff-4d56-beca-5c78328bde44"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "51d975da-fb63-4cd8-9d8b-c637383ab224"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<Direction\>\""], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "8e680355-8418-4f85-b117-3d7f1de348cc"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "d2759f60-a4e9-4c39-81e5-1b83f1c03263"], Cell[TextData[{
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<BothSides\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "71aa78b8-1297-4d33-843a-6efa51acde5c"],
     " (default), ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "c511291c-91cc-4fd3-87f5-459496218b87"],
     ", ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "b2fa9b99-46df-4ebc-96bf-1727c5268eb7"]
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"74c6949e-9940-40af-a7cb-d99ca16e04c3"], 
    Cell[TextData[{
     "which ends may move: ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Forward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e3ce1b35-d398-4ad0-adb7-d52647e507f2"],
     " keeps ",
     StyleBox["p1", "TI"],
     " and extends past ",
     StyleBox["p2", "TI"],
     " only, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<Backward\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "e2b30a9a-2091-4708-9d22-40366fabfeae"],
     " the reverse."
    }], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"157322aa-1eba-4226-8caa-3f86f26499c5"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "91ad502f-9ef9-47c8-911e-d0232753d4d6"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
    "Properties"], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "b54ff633-7082-4ee5-9698-5bfa7fe58599"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "4580a0be-336c-4196-90c6-b090dd9b0c4f"], Cell[TextData[Cell[BoxData[
     RowBox[{"{", "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
     FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
     "fca5a1d3-6102-4f6f-a08c-6a92641db278"]], "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "a7c33465-e143-490e-b6fd-9909caaf8869"], Cell[TextData[{
     "only the empty list; a rule on the extension is a local law and lives \
on ",
     Cell[BoxData[
      TemplateBox[{
        Cell[
         TextData["ExtendInfraGeodesic"]], 
        "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/ExtendInfraGeodesic", 
